# A seat's state (projects, preferences, shared files) never goes in git: a seat gives back text only (AUDIT-ULTRA §13.4).
docs/audits/ultra/sieges/**/etat/
# Replay journals: rewritten by every run of scripts/bench/rejeu-defauts.sh (never committed: the portal needs a clean tree).
docs/audits/ultra/rejeux/_journaux/
